Arithmetica4 — Attribution & Provenance Notice

1. Mathlib4
   This project builds on Mathlib4 (https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4),
   released under the Apache License 2.0.

2. Local & Global Class Field Theory (`RHDirect/Stage13CFT_IdeleNormResidue.lean`
   and `RHDirect/CFT_*.lean`)
   The 15 standalone Local & Global Class Field Theory, Ray Class Field, and Hilbert
   Class Field modules were extracted, consolidated, and adapted to targeted Mathlib
   imports (without `import Mathlib`) from the public `GroundTheory` formalization
   released in Levent Alpöge's Lean 4 archive. All credit for the original Lean 4
   proof architecture of `GroundTheory` belongs to its original author(s).

3. Soundness Transparency
   Please consult `docs/SOUNDNESS_AUDIT.md` for an exact, line-cited classification
   of every theorem in this repository into:
     - Tier A: Unconditional on native Mathlib types (0 extra hypotheses, 0 proxies)
     - Tier B: Conditional reductions / partial campaigns (explicit hypotheses)
     - Tier C: Legacy baseline proxy or toy models preserved for compatibility
